# A feature with a plan and no task list resumes at the menu; continuing writes the task list and codes it.
id: codify-open-plan
skill: highway-codify
fixture: codify-open-plan
open: /highway-codify Restock Alerts
ask: Would you like to:
say: [select] 2
ask: Where would you like to go next?
say: [decline] Nothing else.
writes: code/**
expect: template code/restock-alerts/.highway/features/002-check-reorder-points/codify-tasks.md :: codify-tasks.md
expect: contains code/restock-alerts/.highway/features/002-check-reorder-points/codify-tasks.md :: [X] T001
expect: exists code/restock-alerts/.github/workflows/*.yml
covers: ded7741aec3c The menu offers Review the plan and Continue to code the solution. A feature with a plan and no task list resumes at the menu.
covers: 993e375d731b Continuing emits the building sentence once, then writes the task list ordered by story, each heading with its independent test.
reaches: menu
reaches: tasks
reaches: code
reaches: close
